# Build context for deploy/selfhost (app and web images). Secrets and machine-local state never
# enter an image: every .env file, credentials, local databases, virtualenvs and build output.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/secrets/
**/*.json.key
**/client_secret*.json
**/service_account*.json
**/token.json
**/.venv/
**/.venv-*/
**/venv/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.localdev/
**/.wrangler/
cloud/web/dist/
logs/
output/
state/
input/
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.dump
**/*.dump.partial
deploy/windows/
docs/
.git/
.github/
*.bat
